{"seq":1,"slug":"warp-simt-execution-model","title":"SIMT 执行模型与 warp 线程束调度机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/gpu-kernel-programming-cuda-trriton-simt/simt-execution-memory-hierarchy/warp-simt-execution-model","wordCount":2782,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"simt-执行模型与-warp-线程束调度机制\">SIMT 执行模型与 warp 线程束调度机制</h1><p>写 CUDA kernel 时最容易出错的一步，是把 GPU 当成「有很多核的 CPU」：以为 <code>if</code> 分支各行其是，以为多开线程就能提速。真实硬件里，32 个线程被焊死成一个 warp，共享同一个取指与调度单元，任一线程的分支都会拖住整束。理解 warp 如何被调度、发散如何被摊平、访存如何被合并，是后面所有 CUDA 与 Triton 优化的物理基础——不看这一层，<code>__syncthreads</code> 放错位置、shared memory 补零方向搞反、occupancy 调不上去，都只是症状。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从线程到-warp-的两级映射\">核心概念：从线程到 warp 的两级映射</h2><p>CUDA 的编程模型把线程组织成两层：程序员显式声明 thread block 与 grid，运行期再把每个 block 切成 warp。硬件层的定义很硬——NVIDIA 的 <em>CUDA C++ Best Practices Guide</em> 把 warp 描述为 &quot;the smallest executable unit of parallelism on a CUDA device&quot;，且<strong>所有计算能力世代里 warp 恒为 32 个线程</strong>（Wikipedia <em>CUDA</em> 技术规格表）。block 内线程按线性序号每 32 个切一束，切法固定，与 kernel 逻辑无关。</p>\n<p>真正执行的是 SM。一个 SM 同时驻留多个 block，向上受四类资源卡死：thread 槽位、warp 槽位、寄存器文件、shared memory。下表给出几个关键世代的权威数字（Wikipedia <em>CUDA</em> 与 <em>Hopper (microarchitecture)</em>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构（compute capability）</th>\n<th>warp/SM</th>\n<th>线程/SM</th>\n<th>32-bit 寄存器/SM</th>\n<th>shared mem/SM</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Volta V100 (7.0)</td>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>2048</td>\n<td>64 K</td>\n<td>可配至 96 KiB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turing (7.5)</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>64 K</td>\n<td>可配至 164 KiB / 192 KiB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ampere A100 (8.0)</td>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>2048</td>\n<td>128 K</td>\n<td>可配至 100 KiB / 128 KiB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ada (8.9)</td>\n<td>48</td>\n<td>1536</td>\n<td>128 K</td>\n<td>可配至 228 KiB / 256 KiB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hopper H100 (9.0)</td>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>2048</td>\n<td>64 K</td>\n<td>可配至 100 KiB（L1/shared 合计 256 KiB）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blackwell (10.x / 12.x)</td>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>2048</td>\n<td>64 K</td>\n<td>可配至 100 KiB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意一个反直觉点：Ampere 把寄存器文件翻倍到 128 K（8.0–8.9），而 Hopper 与 Blackwell 又回到 64 K——<strong>架构代际之间不是单调升级</strong>，移植 kernel 时必须重读目标卡的这张表，否则 <code>__launch_bounds__</code> 与 occupancy 计算全部失准。每线程寄存器上限在 3.0 之后锁定为 255（Wikipedia <em>CUDA</em>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Grid&lt;br/&gt;若干 thread block] --&gt; B[Thread Block&lt;br/&gt;最多 1024 线程]&#10;    B --&gt; C[warp 0&lt;br/&gt;线程 0-31]&#10;    B --&gt; D[warp 1&lt;br/&gt;线程 32-63]&#10;    B --&gt; E[...&lt;br/&gt;每 32 线程一束]&#10;    C --&gt; F[Warp Scheduler&lt;br/&gt;每周期择一就绪 warp 发射]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[执行单元&lt;br/&gt;ALU / LSU / SFU]&#10;    F --&gt; H[寄存器文件&lt;br/&gt;每线程私有]\">graph TD\n    A[Grid&lt;br/&gt;若干 thread block] --&gt; B[Thread Block&lt;br/&gt;最多 1024 线程]\n    B --&gt; C[warp 0&lt;br/&gt;线程 0-31]\n    B --&gt; D[warp 1&lt;br/&gt;线程 32-63]\n    B --&gt; E[...&lt;br/&gt;每 32 线程一束]\n    C --&gt; F[Warp Scheduler&lt;br/&gt;每周期择一就绪 warp 发射]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[执行单元&lt;br/&gt;ALU / LSU / SFU]\n    F --&gt; H[寄存器文件&lt;br/&gt;每线程私有]</pre><h2 id=\"warp-调度器与延迟隐藏\">warp 调度器与延迟隐藏</h2><p>SM 内部不是「一个 warp 跑完再跑下一个」，而是若干 warp scheduler 每周期从驻留 warp 里挑一个<strong>就绪</strong>的发射一条指令。GPU 的设计目标写在 Best Practices Guide 里：调度为了吞吐而非单线程延迟——&quot;If the GPU must wait on one warp of threads, it simply begins executing work on another.&quot;。关键在于<strong>上下文切换零成本</strong>：每个活跃线程都有专属寄存器，切换 warp 不需保存/恢复现场，资源一直占着直到线程退出。</p>\n<p>这直接给出「延迟隐藏」的量化条件。设某类操作（如全局访存）的延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 个周期，发射一条指令占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个周期，则需同时驻留的 warp 数至少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\min} \\approx L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，即要用计算盖住访存延迟就得多备 warp。HBM 全局访存延迟量级在数百周期，这解释了为什么 <code>cudaMalloc</code> 之后第一个朴素 kernel 往往只能跑出理论带宽的一小截：不是带宽不够，是 warp 不够多、盖不满延迟。反过来，若 kernel 全是寄存器算术（片内延迟几十周期），过高 occupancy 反而浪费——寄存器被占满后每线程可用寄存器变少，溢出到 local memory 反而更慢。<strong>occupancy 是手段不是目标</strong>，判据应是「延迟是否被隐藏」。</p>\n<p>调度器选择就绪 warp 的策略并不公开，但后果可复现：同一份 kernel 换个 block 尺寸（128 换 256），warp 与访存的配对关系变化，实测吞吐就有差异。因此文档反复强调 block 尺寸取 <strong>32 的整数倍</strong>——不是硬性要求，而是为了让最后一束 warp 不被截断成半束（半束里一半 lane 空转），同时让 warp 内访存天然对齐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分支发散与独立线程调度\">分支发散与独立线程调度</h2><p>SIMT 模型的根本约束写在 <em>Single instruction, multiple threads</em> 词条里：整个 warp &quot;composed of 32 hardware threads executed in lock-step&quot;，只有控制单元持有一个程序计数器（PC），因此 SIMT 在<strong>设计上不允许</strong> warp 内线程各自分支。当 <code>if</code> 让 warp 内线程走向不同路径时，硬件用**谓词掩码（predicate masking）**串行化两条路径：先执行 A 路径（走 B 的 lane 掩掉空转），再执行 B 路径，代价是两条路径的指令数相加。这就是 warp divergence。</p>\n<p>发散的代价可以直接写成利用率。若一个 warp 内 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个 lane 走分支 A（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 条指令）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">32-k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 走分支 B（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 条指令），则有效利用率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>32</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = \\frac{k\\,n_A + (32-k)\\,n_B}{32\\,(n_A + n_B)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>不发散时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">32-k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 均为 16、两路指令数相同时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>，一半的发射槽位浪费在掩掉的 lane 上。实用结论：<strong>按 lane 粒度发散</strong>（<code>if (threadIdx.x % 2)</code>、<code>if (lane &lt; 16)</code>）几乎必亏；<strong>按 warp 粒度发散</strong>（<code>if (threadIdx.x / 32 % 2)</code>）不亏，因为整束 warp 走同一条路。优化发散的第一招往往不是消除分支，而是<strong>重排数据布局</strong>，让同一 warp 的线程天然走上同一条路径——这本质上和合并访存是同一个动作。</p>\n<p>Volta（compute 7.0）引入了一个重要转折：<strong>Independent Thread Scheduling（独立线程调度）</strong>。它给每个线程独立的 PC 与调用栈，让 warp 内线程在真分支处各自推进、需要时再收敛，从而支持 <code>__syncwarp()</code> 这样的 warp 内细粒度同步，也使 warp 级编程不必再依赖「隐式同步」这一危险假设（Volta 之前，warp 内 <code>__shfl</code> 的隐式同步行为是先决条件；7.x 之后正确写法是先显式 <code>__syncwarp()</code>）。这条改变把「warp 内可以安全假设 lock-step」从事实降级为<strong>不可假设</strong>——Volta 起的代码，凡涉及 warp 内数据交换都应显式同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"warp-级访存-合并与扇区效率\">warp 级访存：合并与扇区效率</h2><p>warp 不仅共享取指，也<strong>共享访存事务</strong>。在 compute capability 6.0 及以上，全局访存的硬件粒度是 <strong>32 字节的扇区（sector）</strong>，一个 warp 的访存会被拆成若干个 32 字节事务。Best Practices Guide 给了三组可核验的对照数字（Tesla V100，compute 7.0）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>对齐连续</strong>：32 个线程读相邻的 4 字节 <code>float</code>，恰好覆盖 128 字节 = <strong>4 个扇区事务</strong>；</li>\n<li><strong>未对齐连续</strong>：跨到 5 个扇区，多取 1 个扇区，即 <strong>25% 的过取</strong>；</li>\n<li><strong>步长为 2</strong>：每个 warp 触发 <strong>8 个 L2 段</strong>，load/store 效率降到 <strong>50%</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同一份实测里，对齐的 offset-copy kernel 在 V100 上跑出约 <strong>790 GB/s</strong>，而 V100 的 HBM2 理论带宽是 <strong>898 GB/s</strong>——这就是「合并访存」能兑现的比例。<code>cudaMalloc</code> 的返回值保证<strong>至少 256 字节对齐</strong>，所以把 block 尺寸取成 32 的倍数、让线程连续编号访问连续地址，是拿到满带宽的最低要求。</p>\n<p>一个常被忽视的修正是：L2 会替相邻 warp 兜住一部分过取。文档指出，未对齐时理论只剩 4/5 吞吐，实测却接近 9/10，正是因为邻近 warp 复用了被多取的那条 cache line。这说明<strong>效率下降不是线性的</strong>，但也不可依赖——步长一大，效率就一路掉到「每线程独占一个 32 字节扇区」，warp 为 32 个线程发出 32 个独立事务，带宽利用率约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4/32 = 12.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4/32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12.5%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>修复手段是把<strong>跨步访问改成片内转置</strong>：先把不规则访存以合并形式搬进 shared memory，再在片内按需读取。shared memory 在 2.0 之后固定为 <strong>32 个 bank</strong>，每 bank 每周期吞吐 32 位（4 字节），恰好对应一个 warp 的 32 个线程；不同线程命中同一 bank 的不同地址会串行化，命中<strong>相同地址则广播</strong>（不冲突）。bank conflict 的经典修法（padding 数组错开 bank）与本文的 warp 模型是同一枚硬币的两面，细节见 <a href=\"shared-memory-bank-conflict-occupancy\">shared memory bank 冲突与占用率调优</a>，而 warp 访存事务如何落到 L1/L2/显存各级，见 <a href=\"gpu-memory-hierarchy-coalescing\">GPU 显存层级与访存合并</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"占用率-用资源约束反推-warp-并发\">占用率：用资源约束反推 warp 并发</h2><p>occupancy（占用率）指实际驻留 warp 数占硬件上限的比例，由四类资源里<strong>最紧的那一项</strong>决定。对每线程寄存器数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>、每 SM 寄存器总数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{SM}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的 kernel，由寄存器限制的上界是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mn>32</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{reg} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{R_{SM}}{32\\,R} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以 Ampere A100 为例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>131072</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{SM} = 131072</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">131072</span></span></span></span></span>（128 K）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = 32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>128</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{reg} = 128</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span></span></span></span></span>，远超 64 的 warp 天花板上限，说明此 kernel 不缺寄存器；而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>255</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = 255</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">255</span></span></span></span></span>（上限）时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mn>131072</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8160</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{reg} = \\lfloor 131072 / 8160 \\rfloor = 16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\">131072/8160</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>，只够 16 个 warp，occupancy 被压在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>64</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16/64 = 25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16/64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span>，访存延迟很可能藏不住。这就是重算寄存器往往能提性能的原因——把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 从 255 降到 128，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{reg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 回到 32，并发翻倍。可用 <code>-maxrregcount</code> 或 <code>__launch_bounds__(threads, minBlocksPerMultiprocessor)</code> 让编译器主动压寄存器。</p>\n<p>shared memory 是第二道闸。Hopper/Blackwell 每 SM 上限 100 KiB（L1 与 shared 合计 256 KiB），若每 block 要 48 KiB，则一个 SM 只能塞 2 个 block——即使线程槽位还空着。这带来一个移植陷阱：Ada 的 shared 上限（228 KiB / 256 KiB）远大于 Hopper/Blackwell（100 KiB / 128 KiB），在消费卡上调好的 tile 尺寸搬到数据中心卡上会直接启动失败或 occupancy 崩掉，必须按上表重算。</p>\n<p>Blackwell（10.x / 12.x）延续 Hopper 的 <strong>thread block cluster</strong> 机制：cluster 内多 block 可互访对方的 shared memory（distributed shared memory）并做 cluster 级栅栏同步。cluster 可移植上限在 Hopper 为 8 个 block（H100 非可移植配置可到 16），Blackwell 系列口径为 8（Wikipedia <em>CUDA</em>）。GB100 是双 die 封装、合计约 208 亿晶体管的单 GPU，两 die 间用 <strong>10 TB/s</strong> 的 NV-HBI 互联（Wikipedia <em>Blackwell (microarchitecture)</em>）——cluster 的跨 die 通信延迟可能异于跨 SM，这是 Hopper 时代不存在的新的 block 拓扑变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>warp 是 CUDA 硬件执行的最小单位，<strong>恒为 32 线程</strong>；block 内按线性序号每 32 个切一束，切法与 kernel 逻辑无关。</li>\n<li>GPU 调度为吞吐服务：warp 切换零成本（寄存器私有），要隐藏延迟就需驻留足够 warp，经验上驻留 warp 数应不小于被隐藏操作的延迟（周期数）。</li>\n<li>SIMT 只有单一 PC，warp 内分支靠谓词掩码串行化两路——按 lane 发散几近必亏，按 warp 发散不亏；修发散的首选是重排数据布局。</li>\n<li>Volta（7.0）起 Independent Thread Scheduling 给每线程独立 PC 与调用栈，warp 内不再能假设 lock-step，涉及 <code>__shfl</code> 等 warp 级交换应先 <code>__syncwarp()</code>。</li>\n<li>全局访存在 cc 6.0+ 以 <strong>32 字节扇区</strong>为粒度：对齐连续的 <code>float</code> 读是 4 事务（V100 实测约 790 GB/s，理论 898 GB/s）；步长 2 只剩 50% 效率；修法首选片内转置。</li>\n<li>占用率由 thread / warp / 寄存器 / shared memory 四者中最紧者决定，且<strong>跨代不单调</strong>——Ampere 128 K 寄存器、Hopper/Blackwell 回到 64 K，移植前必须重读目标架构规格表。</li>\n<li>Blackwell 的双 die（NV-HBI 10 TB/s）与 cluster（可移植上限 8 block）让 block/warp 拓扑多出一个 Hopper 时代不存在的变量。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SIMT 执行模型与 warp 线程束调度机制","id":"simt-执行模型与-warp-线程束调度机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从线程到 warp 的两级映射","id":"核心概念-从线程到-warp-的两级映射"},{"level":2,"text":"warp 调度器与延迟隐藏","id":"warp-调度器与延迟隐藏"},{"level":2,"text":"分支发散与独立线程调度","id":"分支发散与独立线程调度"},{"level":2,"text":"warp 级访存：合并与扇区效率","id":"warp-级访存-合并与扇区效率"},{"level":2,"text":"占用率：用资源约束反推 warp 并发","id":"占用率-用资源约束反推-warp-并发"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"GPU 显存层级与全局内存合并访问建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/gpu-kernel-programming-cuda-trriton-simt/simt-execution-memory-hierarchy/gpu-memory-hierarchy-coalescing"}}